{"slug": "rb-ford-transit-2020-commercial-wrap", "url": "https://vinylwraptoronto.com/rb-ford-transit-2020-commercial-wrap/", "title": "Cool Ford Transit 2020 Commercial Vehicle Wrap | RockBottom", "description": "Are commercial vehicle wraps worth it? Check out how we transformed this Ford Transit 2020 into RockBottom's moving billboard.", "ogImage": "/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Ford-Transit-250-High-Roof-Commercial-Full-Van-Wrap-vehicle-wrap-VinylWrapToronto.com-RockBottom-After-Side.jpg", "sections": [{"id": "aad5b5a", "blocks": [{"type": "columns", "cols": [{"width": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 1, "text": "Ford Transit 250 High Roof 2020 Full Van Wrap", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:35px;line-height:1.2em;color:#FFFFFF", "eid": "cc1fcc1", "box": "padding:0px 20px 0px 20px"}], "background": "var( --e-global-color-d077a13 )", "padding": "0px 0px 0px 0px"}, {"width": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Ford-Transit-250-High-Roof-Commercial-Full-Van-Wrap-vehicle-wrap-VinylWrapToronto.com-RockBottom-After-Side.jpg", "alt": "Ford Transit 250 High Roof - Full Van Wrap - VinylWrapToronto.com - RockBottom - After Side - Commercial Vehicle Wrap Cost", "width": "800", "height": "534", "href": null, "full": false, "eid": "0cbbcac"}]}]}], "padding": "50px 0px 50px 0px", "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": "#FFFFFF", "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "b45e69d", "blocks": [{"type": "columns", "cols": [{"width": 74.87, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "<h4>Ford Transit 2020 Commercial Vehicle Wrap</h4> <p>Having a business automatically turns you into a marketer or at least someone who tries to be one. You find yourself getting intrigued by new ideas and think about how you can use those ideas to take your business to the next level. You look for opportunities that promise growth at an affordable price.</p> <p>Do you relate to any of it? We’ve got an idea for you that promises long-term advertising for a one-time payment. That is Promotional Vehicle Wraps. If there’s something that offers complete freedom of design and durability, it is vehicle wraps. The <a href=\"/van-wrap-vs-other-marketing-tactics/\">benefits of getting a commercial van wrap</a> are just too good for the price. </p> <p>Our returning client, the owner of RockBottom Underpinning has been promoting his business by getting the business’s fleet vehicles wrapped in custom-designed wraps. Over the years, the client has realized how effective it is to have a vehicle drive around while showing off the brand.</p> <p>Since it has been working for the client to get more customers, it made sense that he would want to do the same for a subsidiary named “RockBottom Basements”. In order to make people aware of this new business and services, the client decided to get a promotional van wrap for his company’s newest Ford Transit 250 High Roof Van.</p> <p>He wanted a complete colour change from white to a hybrid between Satin Dark Basalt with a custom-designed portion. That shows the power of a custom vehicle wrap. From picking your favourite colour to getting your favourite design printed and then installed on your vehicle, there are no limits when it comes to getting a vinyl wrap.</p> <p>Our design team worked with the client to first design the company logo, and then design the vehicle wrap. Once the client approved the mockup, we started the printing and installation process. </p> <p>At Vinyl Wrap Toronto, we value customer satisfaction above anything else, which is why we always use premium quality material supplied by Avery Dennison &amp; 3M. To fully wrap this Ford Transit, we used the following materials:</p> <ul> <li>White Printable Vinyl – Avery Dennison</li> <li>Satin Dark Basalt – Avery Dennison (SW900-871)</li> <li>Satin Laminate – Avery Dennison (1370Z)</li> </ul> <p>We’ve attached pictures of the fully wrapped Ford Transit 250 for you to see how you can take your vision and put it on your vehicle. </p> <p>If you have a vehicle that you want to turn into a moving billboard that advertises your business, learn about van wrap price, etc., give us a call at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a> or visit our garage located at <a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">24 Ronson Dr, Unit 1, Etobicoke, ON, M9W1B4</a> to speak to one of our team members. Check out <a href=\"/full-van-wrap-toronto/\">more van wraps here</a>. </p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300", "eid": "85e4764"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/object-vinyl-wraps-personalize-objects/", "text": "Prev Previous Object Vinyl Wrap: Customize your favourite everyday objects"}, "next": {"href": "/diy-vs-professionally-installed-stripes-kits/", "text": "Next DIY Stripes vs Stripe Kits Installed By Professionals Next"}, "eid": "0144f5b"}]}, {"width": 25.0, "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Limited Time Offer", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500", "eid": "6026500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get a Standard 3M or Avery Manufactured Full Wrap for a Tesla at", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4em;color:var( --e-global-color-a8178e9 );font-weight:500", "tag": "p", "eid": "adce94b", "box": "margin:10px 0px 0px 0px"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "$4,500 $3,500", "href": null, "style": null, "eid": "a36b238"}, {"type": "button", "text": "Claim Now", "icon": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase", "popup": "popup-limited-offer", "eid": "e4d3235", "box": "margin:10px 0px 0px 0px"}, {"type": "toc", "title": "Table of Con